          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.25
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "Identify filter for PPR templates"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1768144751459"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_IDENTIFY_FILTER_FOR_PPR_TEMPLATES",
          "id": "1768144709479",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768144709480_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Input\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nFrom the above user message, identify the filter(s) from the below ones, that needs to be applied while fetching PPR templates\n- Templates that won't include early payment offer invoices\nacceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_NO' OR acceleratedInvoicesCode=null\n- Templates that will include early payment offer invoices\nacceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_YES' OR acceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_ONLY'\n- Templates that exclusively includes early payment offer invoices (Use this only if the input mentions exclusivity using only or any acronyms)\nacceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_ONLY'\n- Templates that do not exclusively include early payment offer invoices (Use this if the input says \"do not only\", \"not just\", or specifically negates exclusivity)\nacceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_YES'\n\n#Guardrails\n- Don't include anything other than one of the above provided outputs\n\n- DD / Dynamic Discount default rule:\t\n  If the user asks for templates containing DD, templates with DD, DD templates, Dynamic Discount templates, or templates related to DD, treat DD as Dynamic Discount / early payment offer invoice support, not as a literal template-name substring.\t\n  Unless the user explicitly says \"only\", \"exclusively\", \"do not include\", or \"do not only include\", output:\t\n  acceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_YES' OR acceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_ONLY'\n\n# Examples\nInput: Tell me the PPR templates that can select early payment invoices\nOutput: acceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_YES' OR acceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_ONLY'\n\nInput: Tell me the PPR templates that can only select early payment invoices\nOutput: acceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_ONLY'\n\nInput: Show me the PPR templates that do not select early payment invoices\nOutput: acceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_NO' OR acceleratedInvoicesCode=null\n\nInput: Templates that do not only include DD invoices\nOutput: acceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_YES'\n\nInput: Show templates containing DD\t\nOutput: acceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_YES' OR acceleratedInvoicesCode='ORA_DD_ONLY'"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Search template with NER",
            "workflowCode": "ORA_FIN_AP_PAYMENT_EXECUTION_ENTITY_ASSISTANT"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1768144836674"
          },
