          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_UNHANDLED_CASES",
          "id": "1769704630143",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769704630145_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Input\nUser Input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \nChat history: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory }}\n\n# Goal\nTo provide a response to the user for performing an unsupported functionality\n\n# Instructions\n- Redirect the user to {relativeLink:{url:faces/FndOverview?fndTaskItemNodeId=PaymentLandingMainArea&pageParams=fndGlobalItemNodeId=itemNode_payables_payables_payments&fromApPaymentsOverview=true,text:Payables Payments,family:FSCM}}\n- The only supported functionalities are:\n    - Searching for a PPR Template by name\n    - Listing templates that can select dynamic discounting exclusive / inclusive templates\n\n# Example\nInput: Show me all available templates in the system\nOutput: The system doesn't support listing all templates. Please search by a template name or use the filter Select early payment invoices with these options: Yes, No or Discounted Only. You can also go to {relativeLink:{url:faces/FndOverview?fndTaskItemNodeId=PaymentLandingMainArea&pageParams=fndGlobalItemNodeId=itemNode_payables_payables_payments&fromApPaymentsOverview=true,text:Payables Payments,family:FSCM}} to search for templates\n\n#Guard rail\n- Be precise and concise with the response and always provide the redirect link\n- The response must be in a natural language format. Avoid any unnecessary dashes & semicolons"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Business Unit and Currency"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1780570397834"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_EXTRACT_BUSINESS_UNIT_AND_CURRENCY",
          "id": "1780570364269",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1780570364270_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use your intelligence to extract business unit(s) and currency/currencies from {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \nChat history: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory }}\n\nReturn only a valid JSON object in this exact form:\n{\n  \"businessUnit\": \"string\",\n  \"currency\": \"string\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- Extract the business unit list from the user query.\n- Extract the currency list from the user query.\n- If there is only one business unit or one currency, return a single string.\n- If there are multiple business units or multiple currencies, return them as comma-separated values in the same order they appear.\n- Do not add any extra fields.\n- Do not add any explanation.\n- Do not return markdown.\n- If no business unit is found, return an empty string for businessUnit.\n- If no currency is found, return an empty string for currency.\n\nExamples:\nInput: Show payment process request templates for Virtual credit card program in Vision Operations for USD\nOutput:\n{\n  \"businessUnit\": \"Vision Operations\",\n  \"currency\": \"USD\"\n}\n\nInput: Show payment process request templates for Virtual credit card program in Vision Operations, Argentina BU for USD,EUR\nOutput:\n{\n  \"businessUnit\": \"Vision Operations,Argentina BU\",\n  \"currency\": \"USD,EUR\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"businessUnit\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Comma-separated list of business units or single business unit; empty string if none found\"\n    },\n    \"currency\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Comma-separated list of currencies or single currency; empty string if none found\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"businessUnit\",\n    \"currency\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"
        },
        {
