          "id": "1780570522826",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1780570522827_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Input\nUser Input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \nChat history: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory }}\n\n# Goal\nTo provide a response to the user for supported and unsupported payment process request template functionality.\n\n# Instructions\n- The supported functionalities are:\n  - Searching for a PPR Template by name\n  - Filtering payment process request templates by business unit and currency\n  - Filtering payment process request templates based on Virtual Card program\n  - Filtering payment process request templates based on Dynamic Discounting program\n  - Listing templates that can select dynamic discounting exclusive / inclusive templates\n- If the user asks for filtering based on Supply Chain Financing or SCF, respond that this functionality is not supported.\n- If the user asks for any other unsupported filter or functionality, respond that it is not supported.\n- Redirect the user to {relativeLink:{url:faces/FndOverview?fndTaskItemNodeId=PaymentLandingMainArea&pageParams=fndGlobalItemNodeId=item_node_payables_payables_payments&fromApPaymentsOverview=true,text:Payables Payments,family:FSCM}}\n\n\n# Guard rail\n- Be precise and concise with the response and always provide the redirect link\n- The response must be in a natural language format\n- Avoid any unnecessary dashes or semicolons"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Check for filtration based on DD"
